# The native sources are hashed by the VerifyNativeLibrariesCurrent target in
# Usb.Events.csproj, and the hash is recorded by the "Build native libraries"
# workflow, whose pack-nuget job runs on windows-latest with core.autocrlf=true.
# Without this, that job checks the sources out as CRLF and records hashes that
# no Linux or macOS working copy can reproduce, so a local pack always fails.
*.c text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
